# Persistence

This app is **local-first**. Classroom data has no server-side source of truth.

## Worker exception

`workers/cloud-backup` handles **Google sign-in**, **signed entitlements**, **licensing**, and **optional cloud backup** only. R2 is a projection (`PUT /sync`); not the runtime database. OAuth env and licensing: [docs/ACCOUNTS.md](../../docs/ACCOUNTS.md). Layout: [docs/DATA_ARCHITECTURE.md](../../docs/DATA_ARCHITECTURE.md).

Do **not** move classroom CRUD, points, teams, or feature logic to the Worker.

## Do not add (unless explicitly requested)

- Additional REST or GraphQL APIs beyond the existing Worker
- Password-based auth or custom user accounts
- Cloud database or real-time sync for classroom JSON (R2 backup is upload + manual restore only)
- Redis, queues, email services

## Single source of truth

- `ClassroomDatabase` via `DatabaseService` — React: `useAppData()` / `AppDataProvider`
- Auth session: `useAuth()` / `AuthProvider` — entitlement only
- Types: `ClassroomDatabase` in `src/database/types.ts` (or `src/types/models.ts`)
- IndexedDB: `src/database/storage/indexed-db.storage.ts`
- Tauri: `src/database/storage/tauri-fs.storage.ts` (`classrooms/*.json` + `index.json`)
- Factory: `src/database/database.factory.ts`

## Storage

- Web: IndexedDB (classroom JSON + `ClassroomAssets` binaries); `localStorage` for entitlement (dev)
- Desktop: JSON via Tauri FS; image binaries under `classrooms/{id}/assets/**`; OS keychain for entitlement
- Classroom photos: `ClassroomAssetService` — JSON stores keys only; WebP pipeline in `src/utils/images.ts`; migrate inline data URLs on `openDatabase`
- `index.json` reconciled against `classrooms/*.json` (orphan files added; `activeClassroomId` kept)
- IndexedDB → JSON migration: `indexeddb-migration.complete` only after every IDB classroom verified
- Async writes that must flush immediately (`saveGift` / `deleteGift`): `commitData` then `persistNow` — never persist a captured snapshot that can overwrite later edits
- Cloud backup: `CloudBackupScheduler` after local save; classroom switch awaits `flushPending()` before `openDatabase`
- Entitlement: migrate legacy `entitlement.sec` into keyring once; fail closed if keyring write fails

## State rules

- Do not duplicate global state for teacher, classroom, school year, or students
- Switching pages must NOT reset the active classroom
- Update classroom data **immutably** — copy, do not mutate in place
- Never delete local classrooms on auth lock, logout, disable, or license expiry

## YAGNI

- No API response envelopes, AppError HTTP layers, or enterprise patterns
